{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2015/02/02/8725366/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"土曜日は東京個別握手会でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"遊びに来てくださったみなさん\nありがとうございました( ˇωˇ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お留守番ちーむのみなさん\nレポしますよ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1部 おろし巻き\n2部 ポニーテール"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2015/02/02/8725366/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2015/02/02/8725366/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3部 みつあみ\n4部 ツインテール"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2015/02/02/8725366/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前日は都内で大雪が降ったので\n握手会は大丈夫かなー？って\n心配だったのですが\n見事に晴れました\\(  ˆoˆ  )/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"部ごとのはじめのほうに\n来てくださった方は\nひめ手が冷たくてごめんね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんと握手して\nあったまりました♡♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"11th選抜発表後初の個握だったけれど\nみなさん励ましてくださったり\n応援するよ！って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前向きな言葉をたくさん\n掛けてくださって\nひめはパワーを貰いました（ ˆoˆ ）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"11thの製作も頑張るから\n完成を楽しみにしていて下さいね☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会に来てくださる\nみなさんの顔を見てたら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この人たちに喜んで貰えるように\nもっと頑張らなければ！って\nいつも励みになります( ˇωˇ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次の握手会も楽しみ！\n来てくださるみなさん\nよろしくお願いします♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来週は土日～！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4部のツインテールだにゃ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2015/02/02/8725366/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"のぎ天はゴルフサークル！みてね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スクフェスはなんとかギリギリで\nかよちんゲットできたよ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"写メはあすかりんだよー❁"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2015/02/02/8725366/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今夜はいつもよりも少しだけ\n多めに返してますよ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まとめてみて思ったけれど\n食べ物の話題多いなあ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2015/02/02/8725366/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2015/02/02/8725366/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんは牡蠣より肝！？\n肝も最近好きだけど\n牡蠣は小さい頃から食べてるから\nやっぱり好きですよ！\n東京に来て冬になるとごはん屋さんで\n「広島県産 牡蠣」ってよく見るから\n誇りに思います（＾ω＾）美味"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2015/02/02/8725366/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめは雪降ったらはしゃぐ人？\nそれとも冷めて達観しちゃう？\n後者かな......(´-_-｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2015/02/02/8725366/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんはうどんの出汁は\n関西と関東どっちが好き？\n関東に来て関東の食べるようになった今\n関西のが恋しい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2015/02/02/8725366/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"〆は､うどん派or御飯派､どっち?\nどっちも好きだけど\nごはんがいいなあ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2015/02/02/8725366/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お誕生日とか関係なしに、\nプレゼントって貰ってくれるの？\nひめたんが好きそうな物みつけた♪\nわー嬉しい( ´•̥ω•̥` )♡\nありがとう！もちろんだよー！\nひめも何でもない日にでも\n贈り物するの好きだよ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2015/02/02/8725366/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか疲れが取れない時って\nひめたんは何か特別なこととか\nやってる？あったら教えて！\nいつもよりゆっくり\nお風呂に浸かるかな(＊^o^＊)\n夜にミルクティーとかいれたりして\n寝る前にまったりするよ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2015/02/02/8725366/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたん普通のチョコレートと\nホワイトチョコどっちが好き？\n普通の！ミルクチョコレート！\nホワイトはひめには甘すぎる。\nそういえばこの前メンバーと\nミルク派？ホワイト派？って話したなあ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2015/02/02/8725366/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんの定番の朝ごはんは？？\nこれってのはないけれど\n強いて言うならパン派かな～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2015/02/02/8725366/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんはバスケで\nダンクと3ポイントシュート\nどっちのほうがかっこいいとおもう？\n3ポイントかな？個人的に。\nダンクもかっこいいけどね\n基本的にバスケの技って\nキマるとかっこいいよね～\nひめはドリブルで運んでも\nシュートが決まらない子です昔から。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2015/02/02/8725366/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんはのぎ天は\nスマホで見てる？パソコンで見てる？\nスマホ\\(  ˆoˆ  )/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2015/02/02/8725366/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんの日記の\nコメント欄下２ケタに46を踏んだ方へ\n手書きでコメ返するコーナー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼ ひめたん46 ／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2015/02/02/8725366/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2015/02/02/8725366/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2015/02/02/8725366/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもたくさんのコメント\nありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会やのぎ天の感想\nよかったら聞かせてください☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうそう、\nヘタレ！って言われたい人が\nたくさんいたんだけど\nどゆことなん(´・ω・｀)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2月！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カレンダーめくるのは好きだけど\n新しい乃木坂カレンダーは\nなんかめくれない( >_< )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな天使だよ～\n白がよくお似合いだよ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(＊´・ω・＊)"}],"source":"archive"}